156	1250,553,1463,1429	156. Pistil. Stigma. Style. Ovary.	A pistil of Stonecrop, magnified: a long curved style with the roughish stigma at its tip, widening into the ovary, whose lower part is shown cut across with ovules inside.
157	1540,1246,1613,1434	157. Ovule.	A single ovule, still more magnified: a small, narrow oval body on a short stalk.
